  "question": {
    "text": "The centre of mass of a solid hemisphere of radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;from the centre of the flat surface. Then value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Centre of Mass of a solid hemisphere from centre of the&nbsp; flat surface is given by,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math></p>",
